Today is my birthday.
Today I turned thirty-two years old.
I wake up early in the morning.
I open the door and step out into the hallway.
My neighbour Anitha and her dog Tommy are standing there.
Tommy runs towards me happily.
I pet him.
Anitha smiles and comes near me.
"Happy birthday, Maya," she says.
She gives me a small container.
"I have made payasam for you," Anitha says.
"I made it early in the morning," she adds.
I happily take the container.
I open the container.
The hot sweet payasam smells very good.
Tommy looks at the payasam.
He wants some payasam too.
Anitha laughs and moves him back.
"Thank you so much, Anitha," I say.
My day starts very beautifully.
